# Test sources are local-only.
#
# The rule: the test suite never leaves this machine. It is not committed, not
# pushed to the remote, and not part of the production image. These patterns
# are the enforcement - `git add -A` physically cannot stage a test file, so
# the rule does not depend on anybody remembering it.
#
# The suite lives in the working copy only, and `npm run test:clean` removes
# what a run leaves behind.
tests/
__tests__/
*.test.js
*.test.jsx
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.js
*.spec.jsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx

# Generated by a test run
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# admin uploads (runtime user content)
public/uploads/*
!public/uploads/.gitkeep

# formidable stages the raw upload here before it is transcoded; the route
# removes the directory on every request, so it only exists mid-upload
.tmp-uploads/

# generated types
/prisma/generated
# Prisma 7 generated client (regenerate with 
px prisma generate)
generated/

docs/

# Agent instructions: local tooling notes, not part of the project.
AGENTS.md

